# Specified pre-tool path; whole k331 concordance/membership and k332 review precede use.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Source / OS trust\nIndependent prelude original\nEach CP01–CP05; no extra checkpoint" {class: start}
Prelude: "Prelude · Read-only\nCP01: supplied original plan only\nLater: exact locked chain reads"
Select: "Select current anchor\nAccepted + independently validated\nAbsent-next fact; no fallback"
Gate: "Holder gate before launch\nFull original / copy bytes + identity\nRequired image evidence separate"
Holder: "Checked holder opens fixed plan\nRetain every original / copy / parent\nCheck entry before execution"
Pairs: "Serial read-only pairs on fd 3 / 4\nEntry: plan 5; result 6; EOF / reap\nCmp: only 3 / 4; no result frame"
Seal: "Short entry · ENTRY_SEAL\nExact set / directions / pair results\nReset offsets; no pathname reopen"
Ready: "Then engine / display / consumer\nHeld inputs + checks through return\nNo authority fd in comparison child"
Unavailable: "Refuse before affected consumer\nFailed root / anchor: CP01 re-entry\nNo recovery or authority inferred"
Live: "Publication / hosted recovery specified\nWhole concordance / final membership still due\nThen k332 + integrations → k269\nActual originals / controls remain absent"
Start -> Prelude: "1 · finite original / OS trust"
Prelude -> Select: "2 · no scan / repair / writes"
Select -> Gate: "3 · exact original set"
Gate -> Holder: "4 · checked executable only"
Holder -> Pairs: "5 · complete held set"
Pairs -> Seal: "6 · one pair per child"
Seal -> Ready: "7 · exact membership"
Select -> Unavailable: "chain / absence gap"
Gate -> Unavailable: "copy / image gap"
Pairs -> Unavailable: "fd / offset / return failure"
Ready -> Live: "8 · no construction handoff"
